    "## Gson Dependency einbinden (Android)\n",
    "\n",
    "- Datei: `app/build.gradle.kts`\n",
    "- In den `dependencies`-Block einfügen:\n",
    "\n",
    "```kotlin\n",
    "implementation(\"com.google.code.gson:gson:2.11.0\")\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "- Danach: **Sync Now** in Android Studio klicken\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n"
   ]
  }
 ]
